htful experience at the intersection of AI and public policy.", "short_description": "AI for Policymaking\" is a short immersive experience designed for policymakers, and AI enthusiasts. Leveraging virtual and mixed reality technologies, users explore AI's potential in identifying and addressing public sector challenges swiftly and effectively. The app offers a glimpse into how AI can optimize policy processes, providing an engaging and insightful experience at the intersection of AI and public policy."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bump.nu/privacy-policy-ai-for-policymaking-app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bump BV", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.bump.nu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23870839569227385"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974648_361124349576136_2547421232731721472_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OjFfINJU_OIQ7kNvwHP-Ofh&_nc_oc=AdoFR32AT72TWfCjYBZiZrgXEGVpM34-DdPGNBtc1MqwSnoU3Wej6eLOv09S_sogL2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af090m_NrB_UIVvxXQkFwmv2uXzQCD--tfZ0jXy0GUXpGg&oe=69F1FF24"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "AI for Policymaking", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "